<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Defiance half yr profit rises 60 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Defiance half yr profit rises 60 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     6.31 vs 4.39</p>
<p>    Net					3.57 vs 2.25</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)			2.5 vs 2.0</p>
<p>NOTE- Defiance Mills Ltd is a baking and milling group based in Toowoomba, Queensland.  </p>
<p>    Sales				  182.59 vs 174.25</p>
<p>    Other income			   1.59 vs 2.09</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    6.2  vs 2.47</p>
<p>    Abnormal items		  loss 1.29 vs 0.74 loss</p>
<p>Dividend 100 pct franked</p>
<p>Pay date March 27</p>
<p>Reg date March 17</p>
<p>    Tax					1.44 vs 1.40</p>
<p>    Interest				 2.68 vs 2.37</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   4.12 vs 4.07</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
